# Project language: English

All agent-authored project output must be in **English**.

## Must be English

- GitHub issues, PR titles/bodies, review comments, and discussion on tickets
- Commit messages
- Docs under `docs/`, `README.md`, `AGENTS.md`, `SECURITY.md`, and similar
- Code comments, JSDoc, and user-facing UI copy (unless an explicit i18n task says otherwise)
- Test names and assertion messages added or changed by the agent

## Chat

Match the user's language in the conversation. Still write every project artifact above in English.
